    "name": "a year's return chains its daily returns net of the money moved; the index over the same span; the drawdown",
    "spec": "SPEC.md §2 Equity and returns: Yearly return chain-linked, net of deposits; Index over the same span; Max drawdown of the flow-adjusted index",
    "working": [
      "all-time peak 1600, 1 % = 16: every balance clears it, so 2026 is measured from 1 January, over 2025-12-31's 1000 (the last stated day before it)",
      "daily returns: 01-01 1000 ÷ 1000 − 1 = 0; 01-02 1100 ÷ 1000 − 1 = 0.1",
      "01-05: 500 deposited, counted at the end of the day: (1600 − 500) ÷ 1100 − 1 = 0",
      "01-06: 1490 ÷ 1600 − 1 = −0.06875",
      "2026: 1 × 1.1 × 1 × 0.93125 − 1 = 0.024375",
      "index over the same span, from 1 January over the last close before it (2025-12-31, 500) to 2026-01-06: 510 ÷ 500 − 1 = 0.02",
      "flow-adjusted index 1, 1, 1.1, 1.1, 1.024375: peak 1.1 (01-02), trough 1.024375 on 01-06, 1.024375 ÷ 1.1 − 1 = −0.06875"
    ],
    "today": "2026-01-06",
    "accounts": [{"id": "A"}],
    "brokers": {"A": {
      "net_value": {"2025-12-31": "1000", "2026-01-01": "1000", "2026-01-02": "1100", "2026-01-05": "1600", "2026-01-06": "1490"},
      "net_deposits": {"2025-12-31": "1000", "2026-01-01": "1000", "2026-01-02": "1000", "2026-01-05": "1500", "2026-01-06": "1500"}
